An example describing the ticket system (this line is the short description).

The very top line before the "---" is just metadata about the ticket. The "status" item is mandatory, everything else will be parsed, but ignored. Everything below that contains information about the ticket. The first line after "---" is the short description of the ticket. Everything after that is the detailed description.

The name of the file should contain only the ticket number and nothing else. This acts as the unique ID of the ticket.

The status can be one of the following:

    open
    closed

Updates and comments from users can be appended to the end, separated by "---"

This ticket should be considered the format specification.

